cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository or its evidence packs, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Project Simurgh: inspectable authorization for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype for one question: what can an AI agent still do after its authority
  has changed? It puts a gate outside the model that checks each proposed action against the
  host's current state, and keeps the receiver's records so anyone can replay them. Phase 19
  holds 32 evidence packs, each with one command that checks it.
